  <image-generation>
    <model>gpt-image-2 (via Higgsfield)</model>
    <reference-images>
      <ref id="elena-higgsfield" required="true">Reference Elena caricate in Higgsfield</ref>
    </reference-images>
    <prompt-elaborate language="en">
      <![CDATA[
A 45-year-old Italian woman (use Elena Higgsfield reference) sitting in a clean modern home, looking at camera with a serious empathic expression - direct, slightly more solemn than other shots. The look of "this one matters" coach energy.

She wears practical home clothes. NO children visible.

Clean modern Italian setting, soft daylight, NEUTRAL color.

CRITICAL STYLE: PRACTICAL coach moment with weight. Real Italian woman 45.

Composition: Elena center frame chest up, plenty of negative space top/bottom for brand overlay.
      ]]>
    </prompt-elaborate>
    <negative-prompt>cinematic editorial, dramatic, golden hour, model thin, instagram filter, makeup heavy, child visible (privacy), guilt staging, sad theatrical</negative-prompt>
